    "reason": "6b1dd11a draws the hypixel-skyblock tooltips from a copy of the pack whose text shader also sits at 26.1's shader name, so the real client runs the pack's colour swap. 7 of the 44 drawings move by exactly the swap of 8 colours and their shadows - legacy_colours holds FF9000 on 208 pixels and FFAA00 on none - and two fresh boots drew the same 44 files. The sweep's same 7 rows move by those pixels, sum 11.0608 to 52.3139, no row failed: the renderer does not apply the pack's palette yet.",
